<title>USA: TVI receives contract from U.S. Air Force.</title>
<headline>TVI receives contract from U.S. Air Force.</headline>
<dateline>BELTSVILLE, Md. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>TVI Corp said on Wednesday that it received a $379,325 contract from the U.S. Air Force to supply tactical shelters and associated accessories.</p>
<p>The company recently submitted a proposal to the U.S. Marine Corps to supply shelters for the Family of Tactical Soft Shelters Program.</p>
<p>The company also announced that Bruce McFadden had resigned as a director. He has accepted the position of president for a technology firm in the Pacific Northwest.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
